CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5500,http://127.0.0.1:5500,http://localhost:5000,https://lubaga-hospital-asset-booking-syste.vercel.app,https://lubaga-asset-booking-system.netlify.app

# Test database (REQUIRED for running npm test — tests refuse to run without it
